{"title":"Dogwood","slug":"Dogwood","hero":{"file":"Dogwood.webp","width":400,"height":400},"pageid":4918,"revid":22018,"timestamp":"2026-07-01T12:25:32Z","lastEditor":"Ilovechocolateyk","categories":["Trees"],"infobox":{"type":"Wood","fields":[{"label":"title","value":"Dogwood"},{"label":"Island","value":"Flowering Meadows"},{"label":"Hardness","value":"?"},{"label":"Log","value":"$1.5/stud"},{"label":"Sanded","value":"$11/stud"},{"label":"Planked","value":"$13.4/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"?"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"textures","text":"Textures"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Dogwood</b> tree is one of the various trees that can be found in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flowering_Meadows/\">Flowering Meadows</a>. It looks similar to the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sakura/\">Sakura</a> tree but it's leaves slightly brighter, and trunk more brown-grayish.  Also on it's leaves you can find <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dogwood_blossom/\">Dogwood blossom</a>.\n</p><p>Like every other material in-game, it can be used to complete schematics.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"textures\">Textures</h2><p>\nThe various textures of the <b>Dogwood</b> in its raw/log, sanded, and planked states.</p><div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"9f78881edab3d290d143462d0cbaa0a9\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"DogwoodLogT-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/DogwoodLogT.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Log\">Log</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Log\">Log</span></a></div></div><div>Log</div></div><div><div><div id=\"DogwoodSandedT-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/DogwoodSandedT.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Sanded\">Sanded</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Sanded\">Sanded</span></a></div></div><div>Sanded</div></div><div><div><div id=\"DogwoodPlankT-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/DogwoodPlankT.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Planked\">Planked</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Planked\">Planked</span></a></div></div><div>Planked</div></div></div>"}
